{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1475716-ancient-aliens-in-tc","id":1475716,"title":"Ancient Aliens in TC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-02T23:38:42-08:00","id":1475716,"title":"Ancient Aliens in TC","content":"Contrary to unfamous theory, popular science channel - <i><b>In a Nutshell</b></i> - propose idea of Aliens not from far reaching stars - but from ancient history of Earth. Like <b>Weird Fiction </b>tales, civilisations of lizards, cephalopods or other, more 'alien' animal species that rival humanities achievements. See the video - and I invite you to the discussion. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/KRvv0QdruMQ\" data-code=\"KRvv0QdruMQ\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/KRvv0QdruMQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-03T02:05:02-08:00","id":1475725,"title":"","content":"I am not familiar with aliens that came from Earth, but I love the idea of ancient aliens in many forms.<br /> <br /> I would love to see a Adventure! or even TC supplement on The Land of the Lost series (from 1974 or 1991 or the movie from 2009). We have dinosaurs, cave/monkey men, repitilians whith crystal stuff, time and cross time travel and other kinds of weirdnesses. Its just too TC to be ignored...<br /> <br /> Also, I am trying to compile a solid list of aliens from conspirance theories *points vaguely to Alternity books in the desk* since I watched American Horror Story season 10 (the second half of the double feature, to be fair).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-05T16:37:44-08:00","id":1475863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1475716-ancient-aliens-in-tc#post1475716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Contrary to unfamous theory, popular science channel - <i><b>In a Nutshell</b></i> - propose idea of Aliens not from far reaching stars - but from ancient history of Earth. Like <b>Weird Fiction </b>tales, civilisations of lizards, cephalopods or other, more 'alien' animal species that rival humanities achievements. See the video - and I invite you to the discussion. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I love Kurtzgesagt, and the idea this video gave me is 3 ancient Earth civilizations lost to time, as far away from us as they were to each other, and each achieving a different transcendance and vanishing with their techs Yarran-style, leaving no trace of themselves.<br /> <br /> And instead of a Yarran 101 goodbye message, I imagine each race leaving behind them a quantum meme / psionic echo / altered probability that should intelligent life ever appear again on Earth that could inherit their specific potential for transcendance, they would. <br /> <br /> ... and then along come humans, the unknown inheritors of sentient quantum blowfishes, sentient talent dinosaurs and sentient psionic whales, who baffle even the ancient Doyen as to how these barely evolved primates can evolve so fast into so many conflicting directions at once. XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26426-trianoma4evah","name":"Trianoma4Evah","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T20:37:50-07:00","id":1487538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1475716-ancient-aliens-in-tc?p=1475725#post1475725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would love to see a Adventure! or even TC supplement on The Land of the Lost series (from 1974 or 1991 or the movie from 2009). We have dinosaurs, cave/monkey men, repitilians with crystal stuff, time and cross time travel and other kinds of weirdnesses. Its just too TC to be ignored...</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/trinity-continuum-aether-tabletop-roleplaying-game\" target=\"_blank\"><b>TC Aether</b></a> seems to be your book, good lord! Especially with<b><i> Os Viajantes</i></b> ( Travelers ) Society, that is basiclly bunch of explorers 'going to the center of the Earth!' and canoniclly meeting dinosaurs there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}